#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:4
msgid "v4.8.4"
msgstr "v4.8.4"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.8.4 is a reliability and connection-handling release built on the "
"existing Qt Creator 14.0.2 base. It improves USB-drive-to-serial-port "
"matching on macOS, makes camera connect and resync more robust, widens the "
"STMicroelectronics model-zoo catalog, and fixes an Alif firmware-loading bug"
" that could brick boards. There are no breaking changes for user projects."
msgstr ""
"v4.8.4 adalah rilis keandalan dan penanganan koneksi yang dibangun di atas "
"basis Qt Creator 14.0.2 yang ada. Ini meningkatkan pencocokan drive USB ke "
"port serial di macOS, membuat koneksi dan sinkronisasi ulang kamera lebih "
"andal, memperluas katalog model zoo STMicroelectronics, dan memperbaiki bug "
"pemuatan firmware Alif yang dapat merusak board. Tidak ada perubahan yang "
"merusak untuk proyek pengguna."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:20
msgid ""
"**macOS drive matching** now resolves a mounted drive's USB serial number by"
" walking the DiskArbitration/IOKit registry, correctly pairing camera "
"storage drives with their serial port."
msgstr ""
"**Pencocokan drive macOS** kini menyelesaikan nomor seri USB drive yang "
"dipasang dengan menelusuri registri DiskArbitration/IOKit, yang dengan benar"
" memasangkan drive penyimpanan kamera dengan port serial mereka."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Safer Alif firmware loading** no longer erases the MRAM ``APP`` region, "
"which was bricking boards."
msgstr ""
"**Pemuatan firmware Alif yang lebih aman** tidak lagi menghapus wilayah MRAM"
" ``APP``\\ , yang sebelumnya merusak board."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:25
msgid ""
"**More reliable connections** thanks to longer connect timeouts, a retry-"
"with-grace resync, and a single-removable-drive fallback when strict serial-"
"number matching fails."
msgstr ""
"**Koneksi yang lebih andal** berkat timeout koneksi yang lebih lama, "
"sinkronisasi ulang dengan retry-with-grace, dan fallback drive-removable "
"tunggal ketika pencocokan nomor seri yang ketat gagal."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Wider STMicroelectronics model zoo**, now available on ``OPENMV_RT1060``, "
"``OPENMV4P``, ``ARDUINO_GIGA``, ``ARDUINO_PORTENTA_H7``, and "
"``ARDUINO_NICLA_VISION``."
msgstr ""
"**Model zoo STMicroelectronics yang lebih luas**\\ , kini tersedia di "
"``OPENMV_RT1060``\\ , ``OPENMV4P``\\ , ``ARDUINO_GIGA``\\ , "
"``ARDUINO_PORTENTA_H7``\\ , dan ``ARDUINO_NICLA_VISION``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Cleaner System Information** panels rendered as aligned monospaced rich "
"text with a multi-line protocol-capabilities section."
msgstr ""
"**Panel Informasi Sistem yang lebih bersih** yang dirender sebagai teks kaya"
" monospace yang selaras dengan bagian kemampuan protokol multi-baris."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:35
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Perubahan dan peningkatan lainnya"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:37
msgid ""
"On macOS, the IDE resolves a mounted drive's USB serial number by walking "
"the DiskArbitration/IOKit registry from the volume mount path up to the USB "
"device node, fixing serial-port-to-drive matching for camera storage drives "
"(`35fd08410 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/35fd08410>`__). The"
" DiskArbitration and CoreFoundation includes are wrapped in a ``Q_OS_MAC`` "
"guard so non-Mac builds compile cleanly (`5940f3f77 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5940f3f77>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Di macOS, IDE menyelesaikan nomor seri USB drive yang dipasang dengan "
"menelusuri registri DiskArbitration/IOKit dari jalur mount volume hingga "
"node perangkat USB, memperbaiki pencocokan port serial ke drive untuk drive "
"penyimpanan kamera (\\ `35fd08410 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/35fd08410>`__\\ ). Include DiskArbitration dan CoreFoundation"
" dibungkus dalam penjaga ``Q_OS_MAC`` sehingga build non-Mac dikompilasi "
"dengan bersih (\\ `5940f3f77 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5940f3f77>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:44
msgid ""
"When strict serial-number drive matching fails but exactly one removable "
"drive is present, the IDE now falls back to using that single drive as the "
"camera's mount path (`92d13cb10 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/92d13cb10>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Ketika pencocokan drive berdasarkan nomor seri yang ketat gagal tetapi tepat"
" satu drive removable tersedia, IDE kini melakukan fallback menggunakan "
"drive tunggal tersebut sebagai jalur mount kamera (\\ `92d13cb10 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/92d13cb10>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:48
msgid ""
"Camera resync now uses a longer first-attempt connection timeout and retries"
" with a one-second grace timeout, recreating the transport on each attempt "
"to make initial connections more reliable (`2343a9211 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2343a9211>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Sinkronisasi ulang kamera kini menggunakan timeout koneksi percobaan pertama"
" yang lebih lama dan mencoba ulang dengan timeout grace satu detik, membuat "
"ulang transport pada setiap percobaan untuk membuat koneksi awal lebih andal"
" (\\ `2343a9211 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2343a9211>`__\\"
" )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:52
msgid ""
"The device System Information and host/device stats panels now render as "
"monospaced rich text with realigned columns and a multi-line protocol-"
"capabilities section for clearer formatting (`549a6acfa "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/549a6acfa>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Panel Informasi Sistem perangkat dan panel statistik host/perangkat kini "
"dirender sebagai teks kaya monospace dengan kolom yang disejajarkan ulang "
"dan bagian kemampuan protokol multi-baris untuk pemformatan yang lebih jelas"
" (\\ `549a6acfa <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/549a6acfa>`__\\"
" )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:56
msgid ""
"STMicroelectronics model-zoo entries are now available on more boards, "
"extending the catalog to ``OPENMV_RT1060``, ``OPENMV4P``, ``ARDUINO_GIGA``, "
"``ARDUINO_PORTENTA_H7``, and ``ARDUINO_NICLA_VISION`` in addition to "
"``OPENMV_AE3`` and ``OPENMV_N6`` (`ea75eea5f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ea75eea5f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Entri model zoo STMicroelectronics kini tersedia di lebih banyak board, "
"memperluas katalog ke ``OPENMV_RT1060``\\ , ``OPENMV4P``\\ , "
"``ARDUINO_GIGA``\\ , ``ARDUINO_PORTENTA_H7``\\ , dan "
"``ARDUINO_NICLA_VISION`` selain ``OPENMV_AE3`` dan ``OPENMV_N6`` (\\ "
"`ea75eea5f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ea75eea5f>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:63
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:65
msgid ""
"Fixed Alif firmware loading so it no longer erases the MRAM ``APP`` region, "
"which was bricking boards; the IDE now prompts the user to disconnect the "
"camera and turn off the hard-maintenance-mode switch, and to leave the "
"camera unconnected until instructed to reconnect it (`886290d46 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/886290d46>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki pemuatan firmware Alif sehingga tidak lagi menghapus wilayah "
"MRAM ``APP``\\ , yang merusak board; IDE kini meminta pengguna untuk "
"memutuskan koneksi kamera dan mematikan sakelar hard-maintenance-mode, dan "
"membiarkan kamera tidak terhubung hingga diperintahkan untuk menghubungkan "
"kembali (\\ `886290d46 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/886290d46>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:70
msgid ""
"The new (V2) serial protocol probe is now correctly gated to run only on "
"cameras that do *not* have the legacy OpenMV USB VID/PID (i.e. newer "
"cameras), fixing a VID/PID comparison typo that compared "
"``productIdentifier`` twice instead of ``vendorIdentifier`` and a gating "
"condition that previously ran the probe on the wrong devices (`b43b485ed "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b43b485ed>`__, `c86d83870 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c86d83870>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Probe protokol serial baru (V2) kini dikondisikan dengan benar untuk "
"berjalan hanya pada kamera yang *tidak* memiliki USB VID/PID OpenMV lama "
"(yaitu kamera yang lebih baru), memperbaiki kesalahan ketik perbandingan "
"VID/PID yang membandingkan ``productIdentifier`` dua kali alih-alih "
"``vendorIdentifier`` dan kondisi gating yang sebelumnya menjalankan probe "
"pada perangkat yang salah (\\ `b43b485ed <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b43b485ed>`__\\ , `c86d83870 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c86d83870>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:79
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Dukungan platform dan alat"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:81
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 14.0.2."
msgstr "**Basis Qt Creator:** 14.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:82
msgid ""
"**STMicroelectronics model zoo** catalog extended to ``OPENMV_RT1060``, "
"``OPENMV4P``, ``ARDUINO_GIGA``, ``ARDUINO_PORTENTA_H7``, and "
"``ARDUINO_NICLA_VISION`` in addition to ``OPENMV_AE3`` and ``OPENMV_N6``."
msgstr ""
"**Katalog model zoo STMicroelectronics** diperluas ke ``OPENMV_RT1060``\\ , "
"``OPENMV4P``\\ , ``ARDUINO_GIGA``\\ , ``ARDUINO_PORTENTA_H7``\\ , dan "
"``ARDUINO_NICLA_VISION`` selain ``OPENMV_AE3`` dan ``OPENMV_N6``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:87
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Perubahan yang merusak"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:89
msgid ""
"None. This release contains no scripting-API or user-project workflow "
"breaks."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada. Rilis ini tidak mengandung perubahan API skrip atau alur kerja "
"proyek pengguna."
